WEBVTT

00:18:59.538 --> 00:19:02.163
So there is a collegiality
to the culture here.

00:19:02.163 --> 00:19:04.913
When you're a young person
coming up the ranks

00:19:04.913 --> 00:19:08.663
and you need advice irrespective of who
that person is or where they sit in

00:19:08.663 --> 00:19:11.454
the firm's ecosystem, you're
going to get that meeting.

00:19:12.496 --> 00:19:16.454
I'm always making time
for young folks or up

00:19:16.454 --> 00:19:20.663
and coming folks who are trying to figure
out this thing called a career

00:19:20.663 --> 00:19:22.496
because you win in life with people.

00:19:22.913 --> 00:19:25.829
Mendell has opened doors for many
up and coming employers,

00:19:26.204 --> 00:19:27.913
but there's one who stands out.

00:19:28.246 --> 00:19:31.704
He's a Puerto Rican kid from Paterson,
New Jersey,